# Her Memories: Operation Cupid (crystalWar 68), the fourth fragment (carry-harness-2's expect-error step): a level 99
# Warrior in Rolanberry Fields [S] with the WotG mission Her Memories current (other logs as the main flow), the quest
# accepted at Prog 2 (a GM) and the Large Memory Fragments 1, 2 and 4 held (a GM). Batallia Downs [S] from Rolanberry
# Fields [S] at Prog 2: 24, finished: completed (Large Memory Fragment 3), then xi.wotg.helpers.checkMemoryFragments
# counts four and calls player:messageName(ID.text.REPORT_TO_CAIT_SITH, nil): REPORT_TO_CAIT_SITH (6997), Her Memories
# completed, Forget Me Not added (user ruling 2026-11-05, kept bugs: upstream's Batallia Downs [S] IDs.lua had no such
# text, so it raised before completeMission / addMission; the baseline holds the finish as expect-error).
lists BatalliaDownsS/onZoneIn/1 BatalliaDownsS/onEventFinish/24
char zone=RolanberryFieldsS pos=-316.786,-12.448,-117.221 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Wotg HerMemories current
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
quest CrystalWar.HerMemoriesOperationCupid accepted
charvar Quest[7][68]Prog 2
keyitem LargeMemoryFragment1
keyitem LargeMemoryFragment2
keyitem LargeMemoryFragment4
login
warp -71.66,-2.58,450.114 BatalliaDownsS open # from Rolanberry Fields [S] at Prog 2: 24, left open
finish                                  # completed (Large Memory Fragment 3); the fourth fragment: Her Memories completed
